  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.73,
      "end_seconds": 2.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "good afternoon, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.41,
      "end_seconds": 8.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "no problem at all come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.48,
      "end_seconds": 13.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "I'm here cos of itching especially at night"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.69,
      "end_seconds": 18.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.23,
      "end_seconds": 28.29,
      "duration_seconds": 9.06,
      "text": "It's calamine lotion, when needed. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.95,
      "end_seconds": 45.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.23,
      "end_seconds": 49.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "about... well, two years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.74,
      "end_seconds": 53.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "how strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.22,
      "end_seconds": 55.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Mild, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.04,
      "end_seconds": 58.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "okay, is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.49,
      "end_seconds": 71.98,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get scratching sores as well. The scratching sores? That's been for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.3,
      "end_seconds": 78.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Any swollen glands, rash on the face or oozing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.98,
      "end_seconds": 84.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "no no swollen glands rash on the face or oozing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.14,
      "end_seconds": 89.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.64,
      "end_seconds": 93.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "bowels are regular, nothing odd"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.1,
      "end_seconds": 107.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.21,
      "end_seconds": 109.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.45,
      "end_seconds": 113.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.26,
      "end_seconds": 116.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "My mother had a a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.37,
      "end_seconds": 130.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Alright do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.2,
      "end_seconds": 135.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.38,
      "end_seconds": 138.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.46,
      "end_seconds": 144.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.85,
      "end_seconds": 147.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.87,
      "end_seconds": 152.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.16,
      "end_seconds": 154.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.28,
      "end_seconds": 159.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.81,
      "end_seconds": 164.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "are you in work at the the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.93,
      "end_seconds": 169.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.65,
      "end_seconds": 189.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "So, has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.78,
      "end_seconds": 194.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.62,
      "end_seconds": 199.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.74,
      "end_seconds": 214.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.52,
      "end_seconds": 241.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "okay: pulse is 78 beats a minute, BP is 123 over 69, saturation 97 percent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.33,
      "end_seconds": 247.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "alright, over here please and I'll take a look"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.08,
      "end_seconds": 253.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "yeah, no problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.15,
      "end_seconds": 258.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "stay as you are for a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.23,
      "end_seconds": 277.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "there are small burrow-like tracks and red bumps between the fingers and on the wrists, with scratch marks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.02,
      "end_seconds": 314.43,
      "duration_seconds": 33.41,
      "text": "Good you can sit up again. Taking everything into account I'd lean towards scabies. What I'm giving you is permethrin cream 5 percent once, then again after a week for two weeks. That's for scabies. Everyone at home should be treated at the same time and wash bedding and clothes at a high temperature. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.99,
      "end_seconds": 318.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I think I understand everything thanks"
    }
  ]
}